# Deployment and environments

Production currently serves **TEST** Stripe. Pushing `main` may auto-deploy on Vercel — do not treat a tooling-only push as a product release, but confirm no runtime files changed.

Live enablement is **never** a side effect. Checklist: `docs/legal/live-activation-checklist.md`. Until that dedicated task: `LIVE_PAYMENTS_ENABLED=false`.

Do not deploy solely because Cursor rules/docs/tests changed unless runtime code changed.

User-facing payment work: TEST deploy + live browser QA before **Production Ready TEST**. If you cannot log in: **IMPLEMENTED — LIVE QA REQUIRED**.
